        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Fragment of a sari in brocaded silk with metal threads. The field is purple with a trellis design brocaded in gold thread and with floral motifs in the squares. The pallu border has a diaper design brocaded in gold thread. In the corners of the field are two brocaded kakla designs."@en , "Fragment of a sari in brocaded silk with metal threads, Varanasi. India, late 19th century"@en ;
